Third-party components compiled into the firmware binary (firmware.uf2)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Exact versions are pinned in firmware/platformio.ini.

  - Adafruit SAMD Arduino core (framework-arduino-samd-adafruit)
                                        LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - Adafruit TinyUSB for Arduino (bundled with the core)
                                        MIT
  - Adafruit BNO08x                     BSD-3-Clause
      including the CEVA SH-2 driver (sh2*.c, shtp.c)
                                        Apache-2.0 (see its NOTICE.txt)
  - Adafruit BusIO                      MIT
  - Adafruit Unified Sensor             Apache-2.0
  - Adafruit NeoPixel                   LGPL-3.0-or-later
  - cmaglie/FlashStorage                LGPL-2.1-or-later
  - CMSIS (Arm)                         Apache-2.0
  - CMSIS-Atmel (Microchip)             BSD-2-Clause
  - GCC runtime (libgcc) and newlib C library, from the Arm GNU toolchain
                                        GPL-3.0 with the GCC Runtime Library
                                        Exception / BSD-style newlib licences

Release archives include the licence texts of these components in
third-party-licenses/.

LGPL components: each released firmware binary is built from the git tag of
the same name. The complete corresponding source is this repository at that
tag; `pio run` in firmware/ rebuilds the binary, so you can
modify or replace the LGPL libraries and relink.

